		(uuid "fdd0d204-2b41-4bb8-a77b-b6d017cb139d")
	)
	(text "Some pins are used for bootstrapping, and thus\nthey must have the correct state when booting:\nGPIO- state - reason\n9   - FLOAT - Allows code to be downloaded\n		- Has an internal pull-up\n8   - HIGH/FLOAT - Download boot mode\n		- Only checked if 9 is LOW\n2   - HIGH/FLOAT - Prevents glitches\n		- Not technically a strapping pin.\n\nADC1 (5 channels) available on GPIO's 0-4\nADC2 on GPIO 5. Doesn't work? (see datasheet)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 217.678 81.026 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "542db414-0cac-42c8-896a-b5710b617392")
	)
	(text "This RC circuit is\nESSENTIAL to the\nauto-programming\ncircuits function."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 67.31 133.35 0)
		(effects
